ALEX: Then we all pretend we saw it coming and move on to the next oil move on a different geopolitical rumor. The Russell two thousand at twenty-eight sixty-nine is pricing in exactly zero follow-through. This is the Crocs IPO of corporate governance—completely unserious and somehow it's working.

9
